1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,710
Darling, you don't understand my pain.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:10,820
I have THREE hearts. Two for my gills, one for my body.

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:17,680
My blood is blue, because it uses copper, not iron.

4
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:23,510
When I swim, my main heart stops beating.

5
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:26,780
Being dramatic is just good biology.
